This directory holds everything the service WRITES at runtime:

    zones.json              authored floor polygons
    site_calibration.json   per-camera homographies
    face_gallery.json       enrolled employees   (biometric)
    wanted_gallery.json     watchlist            (biometric)

All four are gitignored -- they are per-deployment state, not code. A fresh
clone or a fresh copy of features/ therefore starts EMPTY, which is what you
want when handing this to someone else or standing up a new site.

The files are created automatically the first time you calibrate a camera,
author a zone, or enroll a face. Nothing needs to exist here beforehand.
